  "releaseNotes": "Fixed serial driver & transport defects: concurrency safety, timeout handling and resource cleanup in SerialTransport/IoTSerialDriver; adopt shared DriverCodec.  修复串口驱动与传输层缺陷：并发安全、超时处理与资源清理，使用共享DriverCodec编解码。",
